<title>USA: Lufkin Industries completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Lufkin Industries completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LUFKIN, Texas 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufkin Industries Inc said Thursday it has completed the acquisition of Fannie Lee Mitchell Co of Levelland, Texas, saying it is expected to be accretive to earnings this year.</p>
<p>Fannie Lee Mitchell is an oilfield pumping unit service company operating in the Permian Basin which had revenues of about $10 million last year.</p>
<p>The purchase price was $7.5 million and is being funded by a combination of cash and notes. The transaction will be accounted for by Lufkin as a purchase.</p>
<p>Lufkin said it has been doing business with Fannie Lee Mitchell for a number of years.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
